{
  "_comment": [
    "PLAN.md phase 3 (Njordlinger 1.1: Gear) - the set bonuses (D14) and the unique effects (D15). Defaults set by the build",
    "session on 2026-10-26 while the owner slept; EVERY number is TUNE and the five sets are the PROPOSED ones of",
    "config/sets.json (Q7). The reasoning, per set and per unique, is 4. plans/njordlinger-combat-gameplay-overhaul/GEAR-CONTENT.md.",
    "Built into NjordlingerCombatGameplayOverhaul.esp by tools/PluginBuild (after every class record, so no earlier form ID moves).",
    "Effect kinds are class-content.json's: {av, add, if} a constant effect on an ability spell (shown in Active Effects under the",
    "ability's name); {ep, mult|add, if} a perk entry point. 'kw' names a keyword of the 'keywords' list below, or '@unique' for",
    "the unique's own keyword. The builder ADDS the gating conditions itself, so 'if' holds only the trigger:",
    "  set ability (2 / 4 pieces): GetGlobalValue(NJCGO_Gear_SetsOn)==1 AND WornHasKeyword(set);",
    "  set perk entry (SPID, every actor): the same AND HasSpell(the 2- or 4-piece ability) - the SKSE plugin counts the pieces",
    "  and adds / removes the two abilities;",
    "  unique ability and perk entry (SPID perk, every actor): GetGlobalValue(NJCGO_Gear_UniquesOn)==1 AND WornHasKeyword(unique).",
    "2026-10-26 12:00, Fable Agent's review (GEAR-CONTENT.md section 5): five uniques whose added effect was the same kind as their own enchantment were replaced (Savior's Hide, the Gauldur Amulet, Shield of Ysgramor, Masque of Clavicus Vile, Spellbreaker's conditional); Savos Aren's Amulet keeps its regeneration and gains 'ward spells cost x0.75'. 'dll' on a unique names the part the SKSE plugin does (source/Gear.cpp) - no perk entry point or condition can."
  ],
